      <description align="left" color="orange" colored="true" height="204" resized="true" width="546" x="10" y="264">You may find the lesson &lt;a href="https://academy.rapidminer.com/learn/video/linear-regression-intro"&gt;here!&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Review the ETL subprocesses&lt;br&gt;2. Add Cross Validation (optionally with the Numerical Cross Validation building block). Usethe basic Linear Regression operator (from &amp;quot;functions&amp;quot; subfolder under predictive models). Review the different feature selection criteria.&lt;br&gt;3. Replace or set the Performance with Performance(Regression) and select appropriate metrics.&lt;br&gt;4. Run the model and review the results.</description>
